    <Property ID="5" Name="IoC-SolarWinds-Sunburst - Compromised netsetupsvc.dll present at \Windows\SysWOW64" EvaluationPeriod="P1D">if (x64 of operating system) then (exists files &quot;netsetupsvc.dll&quot; of folders &quot;syswow64&quot; of windows folders) else false</Property>
